---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Events calendar
description: Upcoming district events, vocational visits and networking evenings in Rotary District 3110, with past events linked to their reports.
permalink: /events/
---
{% from "macros.njk" import eventItem %}
<div class="wrap section narrow">
  <h1>Events calendar</h1>
  <p class="lead">Tap an event to add it to your phone's calendar.</p>
  <h2>{{ t.events.upcoming }}</h2>
  {%- for e in site.upcomingEvents %}{{ eventItem(e, t) }}{% else %}<p>{{ t.events.empty }}</p>{% endfor %}
  {%- if site.pastEvents.length %}
  <h2>{{ t.events.past }}</h2>
  {%- for e in site.pastEvents %}{{ eventItem(e, t) }}{% endfor %}
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="small">Want your club's event here? <a href="/submit/">Send it through the activity form</a> and choose "An upcoming event".</p>
</div>
